<title>MALAYSIA: TA Enterprise sets placement price.</title>
<headline>TA Enterprise sets placement price.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial services firm TA Enterprise Bhd said on Wednesday that a previously-announced private placement of stock has been priced at 3.30 ringgit per share.</p>
<p>In a statement, it said it has started the placement of 60 million new shares.</p>
<p>The placement price represents a discount of about 7.3 percent to the weighted average market price of TA Enterprise shares for the past five market days, it said.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
